          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>We were looking for a solid filter that would be easy to maintain, easy to build, long lasting, and effective. Meets the mark on all accounts!</p>",
            "reviewer": "Andrew Narduzzi"
          }
        },
        "text_f86zpb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p><strong>Makes the water taste better</strong></p><p>I've been using this water filter for a few months now. It's been fantastic. I can smell a strong chlorine odor when filling the system, and after its filtered, there is no smell. The taste is so much better after its filtered as well. Highly recommend!</p>",
            "reviewer": "Justin"
          }
        },
        "text_Tf3LMc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p><strong>Amazing solution to a big problem!</strong></p><p>I absolutely love that there's an option to remove fluoride from our water. Most filtration systems are not able to unless it's reverse osmosis, from my research. These are easy to install and give me peace of mind that we are consuming the purest water possible!</p>",
            "reviewer": "Jenny"
          }
        },
        "0cc7a6ba-eb83-4ad4-aa8e-a1be39607916": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p><strong>I had the other well named one from another company and Phoenix is better</strong>,&nbsp;</p><p>The other company is terribly bad at customer services and rude and don’t care if you have a problem like when I ordered things that didn’t come and they literally said I was wrong and I got my things but I didn’t and called me a thief….very rude and unprofessional.</p>",
            "reviewer": "David"
          }
        },
        "text_YhR4Xi": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p><strong>I love it! We have such peace of mind knowing our drinking and cooking water has been filtered</strong></p><p>2.5 gallons is perfect for 2 people using it for drinking and cooking water + water for our pets.</p>",
            "reviewer": "Cheryl Shepard"
          }
        },
        "268fbfd8-392e-437f-b2bf-8b826c84550c": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p><strong>I’m really happy that I made this choice.</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>I looked into electric and natural steam filters and found that they would cost a lot of time and energy waste by needing up to 4hrs to purify water.&nbsp;</p>",
            "reviewer": "Victoria"
          }
        }
      },
